        "content": "<p>I've been slowly chipping away at <a href=\"https://github.com/markusdemedeiros/Eileen\">implementing</a> the foundations of Iris in Lean. My goal is to mechanize up to uPred and hook it up to iris-lean; as of now I've implemented a good chunk of the results about OFE's and I'm starting to move up to work on cameras. </p>\n<p>This seems like the right place to ask: is anyone else continuing the iris-lean project or otherwise developing Iris in Lean? It would be great to combine our efforts if so :)</p>",
        "id": 492508847,
        "sender_full_name": "Markus de Medeiros",
        "timestamp": 1736344280
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I believe <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"110049\">@Mario Carneiro</span> is the maintainer of iris-lean now.</p>",
        "id": 492514361,
        "sender_full_name": "Jireh Loreaux",
        "timestamp": 1736346015
