    {
        "content": "<p>I don't think there's anything blocking someone from adding the definition of a language+operational semantics+weakestpre+tactics to the existing iris-lean (treating <code>BI</code> as axiomatic and not proving adequacy wrt. Lean). Idk if anyone is working on such a thing (maybe <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"110049\">@Mario Carneiro</span> knows?), but in principle that could be done without the model.</p>",
